{
  "id": "views",
  "title": "A view is not a document",
  "group": "Tac views",
  "summary": "Each page and each component has a view (an HTML template). The `tac.html` of a page places components. The `tac.html` of each component defines its content. The compiler creates the document around them. If a view contains a doctype, `<html>`, `<head>` or `<body>`, the build fails with `TY1307`. Tachyon cannot merge a head that you write with the head that it generates. A Python service also needs the `tac.python` runtime setting in `client/manifest.json`.",
